  "body": "Moved from https://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/1572\r\n\r\n> Two ways of doing this: an email->matrix bridge, or 'reply' links on the notifs. We already have the latter, so I assume this is the former. The bridge would not be easy though as if you have multiple notifs in the email, which are you responding to?\r\n\r\n> A better solution would be a separate email<->matrix bridge I suspect.",
